#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomProfessionalTradingWorkstationPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend canonical trading presentation with professional workstation
#   calculations for watchlists, depth/DOM, charts, Time and Sales, guarded
#   execution, portfolio/P&L, alerts, scanners, events and linked context.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   The existing trading workspace, market-data, order, risk and context
#   services remain authoritative. These sources calculate copied projections
#   and readiness state only; no second broker or execution engine is created.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
